CHAPTER.VERS:
Yea, he had
Read (Gen_32:24-32). power over the angel, and prevailed: he wept, and made supplication unto him:
God found Jacob as he lay sleeping in Bethel (Gen_28:12), and spoke with him there in such a way that the fruit of that speech appertained to the whole body of the people, of which we are. he found him [in] Bethel, and there he spake with us;
